# The Hyprland desktop.
#
# waybar is installed but its unit is deliberately left un-enabled: it stays a
# fallback bar while the Quickshell one grows to parity. See
# docs/hyprland-startup.md.
hyprland
# Hyprland links liblua5.4.so.5.4 at runtime. extra/lua54 is a real package that
# ships it -- do not substitute a `provides=('lua54')` shim, which satisfies
# dependency resolution while leaving the library absent, so Hyprland dies at
# start with "cannot open shared object file" and greetd restart-loops.
lua54
uwsm
mako
libnotify
kitty
rofi
waybar
quickshell
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
qt5-wayland
qt6-wayland
grim
slurp
hyprshot
hyprpaper
hyprpicker
hypridle
hyprlock
hyprcursor
hyprpolkitagent
